OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794986646
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWaymo pulls driverless taxis from all
OL,4,AUS freeways
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaymo said it was working with state
OL,7,Fofficials "diligently and responsibly
OL,8,Fto resume freeway operations", adding
OL,9,Fthat no injuries or collisions were
OL,10,Freported following the incident on US
OL,11,FRoute 101 south of San Francisco.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
