OL,3,AJeff Bezos says he was 'heavily
OL,4,Ainvolved' in casting Robert Pattinson
OL,5,Aas new 007
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis will be the first 007 not under
OL,8,Fthe creative control of the Broccoli
OL,9,Ffamily, who had overseen the franchise
OL,10,Fsince the first Bond film in 1962.
OL,11,FAmazon purchased MGM, which co-owns the
OL,12,Ffranchise, in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
